as7422@columbia.edu>, Hengyu Li <hl3828@columbia.edu>, Jie Zhou <
jz3925@columbia.edu>, Roxy Blocksdorf <rb3722@columbia.edu>


Hi everyone,

Thanks for submitting your thesis updates. I've really been enjoying
looking at them! Let me know if you have any suggestions for changes to the
format -- I want them to be helpful to you.

I'm not going to be a stickler for when these should be in, but I do want
to see something every week. Tomorrow is Friday, and so far only 2 of you
have submitted a status update for this second week! I'm hoping the rest of
you are planning on sending something tomorrow.

We meet on Wednesday next week -- I'm hoping that everyone will give a very
quick update on how things are going, and then I'm expecting a third weekly
update by Friday the 23rd.

All the best!
Dory



